---
title: "Architecture"
---

## Execution Path

```text
config/default.toml + data/example/observations.csv
  -> Pydantic configuration boundary
  -> Hamilton nodes
  -> Polars lazy transformation
  -> AnalysisResult
  -> deterministic JSON artifact
```

The CLI, tests, and any future API must call `analyze()` rather than duplicate transformation logic.

## Ownership

repo-familiar generated the initial scaffold. Source, manifests, locks, CI, and documentation become downstream-owned working files; future refresh remains explicit and manual by default.
